<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>ensur - agent action verifier</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0b0f14;--card:#131a23;--line:#22303f;--txt:#e8eef4;--dim:#8fa3b5;--grn:#2fbf71;--red:#e5484d;--amb:#e8a13c;--acc:#4c9be8}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.55}
.wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 60px}
h1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 6px}h1 .e{color:var(--grn)}
.sub{color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 26px;font-size:15px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin:16px 0}
.ask{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
input{flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#0d1420;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;color:var(--txt);padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px}
button{background:var(--grn);color:#06210f;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}
.chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}
.chip{background:#0d1420;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}
.chip:hover{color:var(--txt);border-color:var(--acc)}
.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr;gap:6px 14px;font-size:14px}
.kv .k{color:var(--dim)}
.badge{display:inline-block;border-radius:6px;padding:2px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
.ok{background:#10231a;color:var(--grn)}.bad{background:#2a1213;color:var(--red)}.warn{background:#2a2110;color:var(--amb)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px}
td,th{padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}
.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;word-break:break-all}
.pass{color:var(--grn)}.fail{color:var(--red)}
h2{font-size:16px;margin:22px 0 8px;color:var(--txt)}
.note{color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px}
#out{display:none}
a{color:var(--acc)}
</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<h1><span class="e">ensur</span> agent action verifier</h1>
<p class="sub">Every action an agent takes leaves one record: attested by both sides, bound to the authority it ran under, hash-chained the moment it settles. Paste an action ID and replay the proof yourself.</p>
<div class="card">
<div class="ask"><input id="q" placeholder="action ID, e.g. ak-&hellip;" spellcheck="false"><button onclick="verify()">Verify</button></div>
<div class="chips" id="chips"></div>
</div>
<div id="out">
<div class="card">
<div class="kv" id="rec"></div>
</div>
